<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Speak to me, Lord every day.</l><l>Speak to me, Lord—I love to hear what You say.</l><l>Speak to me, Lord, fill me with light.</l><l>Speak to me, Lord all Your words of life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
